#: includes/class-privacy.php:39
msgid "This site uses Dragon Login Security for brute-force protection and two-factor authentication. It stores, in this site&#8217;s own database: each enrolled user&#8217;s authenticator secret (encrypted), backup codes (hashed), and passkey public keys with device labels; and, for brute-force protection, the IP address and attempted username of failed logins. Lockout records are pruned automatically on a retention schedule. No data is sent to any third party."
